---
pagination:
  # Convoy has a real page (src/tajima-convoy.njk), so it is excluded in
  # _data/locationStubs.js. Do NOT filter with `pagination.before` here:
  # `before` must be a real function, YAML cannot express one, and a string is
  # ignored silently rather than erroring.
  data: locationStubs
  size: 1
  alias: loc
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ loc.url }}"
pageKey: locationStub
noindex: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Tajima Ramen {{ loc.name }} | {{ loc.address.locality }}, {{ loc.address.region }}"
  description: "Tajima Ramen {{ loc.name }}, {{ loc.address.street }}, {{ loc.address.locality }}. Address and phone. Walk in, no reservations."
---
{#
  ============================ STUB PAGES ============================

  THESE ARE NOT FINISHED PAGES AND MUST NOT GO LIVE AS THEY ARE.

  Built tonight for one reason: /locations/ is a P1 page that linked to six
  URLs that did not exist. Six 404s off the site's router is worse than six
  thin pages behind a noindex.

  They carry `noindex` deliberately. These URLs have existing traffic on the
  current site (SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md: existing location URLs do not change
  precisely because they earn it), and shipping thin content on a page that
  already ranks is a regression, not a placeholder. Noindex keeps them out of
  the index until the real page replaces them. Removing the noindex is part of
  finishing the page, not a separate decision.

  CONTENT RULE FOR THIS TEMPLATE: everything on the page comes from
  locations.json, which carries the SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md NAP table. Nothing is
  written here. The one line of prose per location is the `summary` field,
  which was already sourced from CLIENT_FACTS.md for the /locations/ cards, not
  drafted tonight.

  Hours are absent, as everywhere else. Open Decision #9. The page says so
  and offers the phone number instead of guessing.

  What each of these still needs before launch, per the location page template
  in SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md: real photography of this room, the "what's different
  here" section (the one section the brief says must not be templated), this
  location's menu section once menu.json has the availability column, its happy
  hour block, its Toast ordering URL, its nearest-neighbour link, and its GBP
  and Yelp URLs for `sameAs`.
#}

<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="page-hero__inner">
    <p class="page-hero__crumbs">
      <a href="/">{{ site.name }}</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/locations/">Locations</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="page-hero__crumbs-current">{{ loc.name }}</span>
    </p>
    <span class="page-hero__eyebrow">
      {%- if loc.opened %}Since {{ loc.opened }} &middot; {% endif -%}
      {{ loc.neighborhood }}
    </span>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title" id="page-title">{{ loc.name }}</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__lede">{{ loc.summary }}</p>

    <address class="plate">
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Address</span>
        <span class="plate__value">{{ loc.address.street }}, {{ loc.address.locality }}, {{ loc.address.region }} {{ loc.address.postalCode }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Phone</span>
        <a class="plate__value" href="tel:+1-{{ loc.phone | replace('(', '') | replace(') ', '-') | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ loc.phone }}</a>
      </span>
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Hours</span>
        {# Not a placeholder for a value we have. We do not have it, and
           CLIENT_FACTS.md says do not publish hours the door does not honor. #}
        <span class="plate__value">Being confirmed. Call the room.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Directions</span>
        <a class="plate__value" href="{{ loc | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open in Maps<span class="u-visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span></a>
      </span>
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Seating</span>
        <span class="plate__value">Walk in. No reservations.</span>
      </span>
      {%- if loc.parking %}
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Parking</span>
        <span class="plate__value">{{ loc.parking }}</span>
      </span>
      {%- endif %}
      <span class="plate__item">
        <span class="plate__label">Menu</span>
        <a class="plate__value" href="/menu/">See the menu</a>
      </span>
    </address>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sect" aria-labelledby="soon-title">
  <div class="sect__inner">
    <header class="sect__head">
      <span class="sect__eyebrow">This page</span>
      <h2 class="sect__title" id="soon-title">The full page is <em>coming.</em></h2>
      <p class="sect__note">
        Address and phone are right, and they are the same everywhere we publish them. The rest of this room, its photographs, what is different about it, and its own menu, is being written. In the meantime, <a class="sect__link" href="/menu/">the menu</a> and <a class="sect__link" href="/locations/">the other rooms</a>.
      </p>
    </header>
  </div>
</section>

{# The noodle line, universal section 6 of the location page template. #}
<section class="noodle-band" aria-labelledby="band-title">
  <div class="noodle-band__inner">
    <div>
      <h2 class="noodle-band__slogan" id="band-title">Better noodles weren't for sale. <em>So we made them.</em></h2>
      <p class="noodle-band__body">
        {#
          Scoped to San Diego on purpose. Crown Point supplies San Diego and
          Maui is 2,500 miles away, so no "our noodles" claim extends there.
          SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md Open Decision #1.
        #}
        {%- if loc.region == "san-diego" %}
        The noodles are made in our own Noodle Room in Crown Point, and the broth is simmered there every morning and driven out before service.
        {%- else %}
        Sam spent two years building a noodle room in Crown Point, on a machine brought over from Japan.
        {%- endif %}
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="noodle-band__cta" href="/noodle-room/">
      See the Noodle Room
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M1 7H13M13 7L7.5 1.5M13 7L7.5 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
